<title>UK: Guinness Flight plans 15 mln stg cash call.</title>
<headline>Guinness Flight plans 15 mln stg cash call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guinness Flight Venture Capital Trust Plc said on Monday it planned to raise 15 million stg through a rights issue in February.  </p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
